          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Yeoram Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, abu Yeosapat totwana ikwapei atapapaa keŋ, ido aponi tonukae lotaun a Daudi neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ. Abu Yeoram lokoku keŋ kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Yeoram ŋikaitotoi keŋ ŋidwe a Yeosapat a papa keŋ, ŋirorwa kec ikes lu: Asaria, Yeiel, Sakariya, Asaria, Mikael ka Sepatia. Arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋidwe a Yeosapat a erwosit a Yudaya ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu papa kec inak ikes ŋainakineta ŋuna alalak nooi ŋuna a esilipa, a egolid ka ŋiboro ŋice ŋulu epol egyelit, abu inak ikes tari ŋitaunio alo Yudaya ŋulu adukitoe ŋaduketa ŋunajiet, nai abu Yeosapat inak apukan neni a Yeoram, anerae Yeoram arae ekiyae keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau Yeoram akisicat apukan keŋ ejok anakwap a ŋina sek epukat papa keŋ, abu toar ŋikaitotoi keŋ daadaŋ kaapei ka ŋikapolok ŋice ŋulu anakwap a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yeoram ŋatomoniuni ka ŋiarei apaki ŋina esyakinia iŋes akipuka, kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋikanikauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeoram kiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna aronok ŋuna etiyato ŋirwosi a Isirael, kitiya Yeoram lopite ŋolo etiyator ekal ŋolo ka Aab, anerae arae aberu keŋ nakoku ka Aab. Abu Yeoram kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari kikote neni daŋ, pa acamit Ekapolon akinyasun apukan a ekal a Daudi, anerae eikinit sek iŋes eketiyan keŋ Daudi atemar etoropari ŋiletok keŋ ipukato ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toŋero ŋituŋa a Edom ekipukae a Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa ŋulu epukator Yeoram Yudaya, apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu ka akwap a Edom toŋero epite ŋolo epukator erwosit a Yudaya ikes; topakaros ikes kipukakinos make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tonyout Yeoram ka ŋikarikok a ŋasigarya keŋ ka ŋikametok ŋaŋolei ŋuna a ŋagaari, toloto nakwaare akitijikin Ŋiedomi ŋulu keris kirikaut iŋes kaapei ka ŋikametok ŋaŋolei ŋuna a ŋagaari keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, eriŋa ŋituŋa ke Edom eŋerito atemar kipuka Yudaya akwap kec. Ŋituŋa a Libina daŋ toŋero ŋirwa ŋulupei atemar kipuka ikes erwosit a Yudaya, anerae kebu Yeoram toŋer Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaruwa aneni ke Eliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeoram toduk ŋaduketa ŋunakilipet ŋakujo nakiboisyo ŋunamukur alo Yudaya. Abu kibata ŋituŋa a Yerusalem kituruwo ŋulu pa ekinyomito Akuj, apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya toŋero Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi yaunae abaruwa neni a Yeoram aneni ke Eliya a ekadwaran ebala, “Ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon Akuj a papaa kon a Daudi ikes nu ebe, ‘Nyiwuapa iyoŋ ŋuna amaikina kiwuap lopite ŋolo abunio papa kon Yeosapat kiwuapya, kori lopite ŋolo abunio Asa erwosit a Yudaya kiwuapya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai iwuap iyoŋ ŋuna itiyaete ŋirwosi ŋulu a Isirael ka ituruwo iyoŋ ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋulu iboiyete alo Yerusalem ŋulu nyikinyomito Akuj lopite ŋolo aponiata ŋituŋa a ekal ka Aab kitiyata ka daŋ aŋuna iarya iyoŋ ŋikaitotoi kon, ŋituŋa a ekal a papa kon ŋulu ajokak akilo iyoŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiira tokona, eyauni Ekapolon akisicanet ŋina apolon nooi lotuŋa kon, lodwe kon, naberu kon ka neni a ŋinibore daadaŋ iyakar iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyoŋ daŋ elope idyakakin nooi edeke ŋolo a ŋiboro a akook ŋolo iata a ŋinakoloŋit akitodol ŋina itolomunia edeke ŋol ŋiboro a kook kiŋa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon inak Ŋipilistin ka Ŋiarabi ŋulu ayakasi diyete Esiopia kimana Yeoram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋipilistin ka Ŋiarabi ŋul toremo Yudaya, yaasi ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu aya kai a erwosit, yaasi tari ŋidwe a erwosit ŋulusapa ka ŋaberu a erwosit. Mam Isapat abu Yeoram kidoŋioto, mati Aasia bon lokoku keŋ ŋolo cici.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Yeoram",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋakiro a ŋun daadaŋ, abu Ekapolon kitedyakak Yeoram edeke ŋolo a ŋiboro ka akook, ŋolo amam ekitoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋikaru ŋiarei, abu edeke ŋol kikam Yeoram erono nooi akitodol ŋina eridakinia eryeba nooi. Apotu ŋituŋa keŋ nyinokokis akim akitoodiun akitopoloorit iŋes lopite ŋolo enokonokiniata akim akitopoloorit atapapaa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Yeoram ŋatomoniuni ka ŋiarei isyakini akipuka Yudaya. Abu iŋes kipuka Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋikanikauni. Mam ituŋanan abu kiyaloloŋ aŋuna keŋ apaki ŋina atwania. Aponi tonukae iŋes lotaun a Daudi, nai meere neni anukitae ŋirwosi ŋuluce.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
